Build "Personal Management Tracker", a production-grade personal finance and budget management web application with rich visuals, AI-powered transaction categorization, and dynamic analytics.

Key Architectural & Design Principles:
1. Design & UI Aesthetics:
   - Modern, high-end dashboard interface with Tailwind CSS, custom gradients, clean typography, rounded cards, and responsive layouts.
   - Use Lucide React icons for all navigational and contextual iconography.
   - Never produce cookie-cutter or bare-bones MVPs; maintain rich, interactive micro-animations, badges, and progress bars.
   - Module imports must use the `@/` path alias pointing to `src/` (e.g. `@/components/SpendingChart`).

2. Core Functional Requirements:
   - Financial Overview Dashboard:
     * Live metrics: Total Income, Total Expenses, Net Savings, and Savings Rate dynamically calculated from transactions.
     * Financial Health circular score gauge.
     * Money Pulse trend chart (Income vs Expenses vs Savings over time) with currency-aware tooltips.
     * Spending DNA category breakdown donut chart with legends and amounts.
     * Monthly budget progress indicators.
     * Recent activity transaction list with category icons and status badges.
   - Transaction Management:
     * Full CRUD for Income and Expenses with date, amount, description, type, and category selection.
     * Automatic AI categorization workflow with confidence scoring.
     * Multi-field filters: search query, transaction type (income/expense), category, and month filters, plus date sorting.
     * Multi-selection checkboxes: row checkboxes and master select-all header checkbox.
   - Demo Data Management:
     * Pre-loaded sample transactions for immediate dashboard preview and testing.
     * Prominent banner with a dedicated checkbox option: "Select all demo data" to check all sample items at once.
     * "Delete all demo data at once" bulk deletion action with confirmation modal.
     * "Load Demo Data" / "Clear Demo Data" toggles with persistent state (`finwise_demo_data_cleared`).
     * Real user-added transactions are protected from demo deletions.
   - Monthly Budgets:
     * Category-specific monthly budget creation, tracking, and deletion.
     * Real-time spending comparison against budget limits with visual progress bars.
   - Offline & Local Storage Resilience:
     * Seamless dual-mode persistence: automatically syncs to Supabase when authenticated, with automatic fallback to persistent browser storage (`localStorage`) in offline or guest mode.
     * Prevents Row-Level Security (RLS) 42501 errors when operating without an active Supabase user session.
